Auntie came to our place.

28:19.989 --> 28:21.616
Said you hadn't come home.

28:22.575 --> 28:23.702
Get to the point.

28:25.620 --> 28:26.788
What I want to ask is…

28:28.039 --> 28:29.207
That fentanyl.

28:30.583 --> 28:32.210
What if you put it on your skin?

28:32.711 --> 28:33.795
Like on your neck?

28:36.339 --> 28:38.091
Well, it'd be weaker.

28:38.925 --> 28:41.010
But since it's a painkiller,

28:42.637 --> 28:44.305
you'd get dizzy and sleepy.

28:44.931 --> 28:46.558
Worst case, you'd vomit.

28:47.225 --> 28:48.226
Why?

28:50.019 --> 28:52.230
No reason. I'm just curious.

28:55.942 --> 28:56.901
Yeong-bin.

28:57.527 --> 28:58.445
Yeah?

28:59.154 --> 29:00.196
Watch yourself.

29:03.032 --> 29:04.617
What are you talking about?

29:10.206 --> 29:11.040
Bye.

29:14.669 --> 29:16.838
Fuck, what a worthless asshole.

29:30.643 --> 29:32.729
Ji-won, what's up?

29:40.069 --> 29:42.822
FATHER:
EVERYTHING OKAY?

29:48.787 --> 29:50.955
YES

30:07.096 --> 30:07.931
You…

30:10.308 --> 30:12.227
We usually just drop it off.

30:13.645 --> 30:15.021
No direct handoffs next time.

30:18.858 --> 30:19.692
Yeah?

30:19.776 --> 30:21.110
FENTANYL PATCH

30:22.070 --> 30:24.113
It's not for him. The buyer's a girl.

30:28.451 --> 30:30.453
Oh shit, my bad.

30:32.580 --> 30:33.498
Move it.

30:35.959 --> 30:36.835
What?

30:38.419 --> 30:39.337
I said move it.

30:40.088 --> 30:40.922
Out of the way.

30:41.506 --> 30:43.466
Well, that's fucking rude.

30:43.967 --> 30:44.968
You want to die?

30:46.094 --> 30:48.763
I sure as shit don't like that look.

30:54.477 --> 30:55.311
Hey.

30:56.563 --> 30:57.647
Quit staring.

31:00.358 --> 31:03.736
Stop fucking staring,
or I'll chop your head off.

31:06.614 --> 31:07.574
Bro?

31:09.033 --> 31:09.868
Go.

31:18.918 --> 31:20.336
You need to read people better.

31:21.004 --> 31:22.505
He was going to stab you.

31:24.841 --> 31:26.050
MOCK TEST IN ONE DAY

31:39.898 --> 31:41.232
Hey.

31:49.908 --> 31:52.035
Hey, the teacher wants to see you.

31:54.954 --> 31:56.331
The homeroom teacher.

32:14.724 --> 32:15.558
Take it.

32:17.894 --> 32:18.728
Thanks.

32:28.821 --> 32:29.739
Hey, man.

32:30.406 --> 32:32.575
Seems like you had a hard time at Mungang.

32:37.372 --> 32:38.998
I called Ji-won yesterday.

32:41.167 --> 32:42.001
What?

32:43.294 --> 32:45.880
He said you got beaten up so fucking bad.

32:50.718 --> 32:52.220
Is that why you transferred?

32:52.720 --> 32:53.972
Like a fucking loser?

32:59.686 --> 33:00.687
I mean,

33:01.521 --> 33:03.523
I'm not gonna do anything.

33:04.232 --> 33:05.692
Let's just be friends.

33:08.903 --> 33:09.779
Sit.

33:12.907 --> 33:13.866
Okay.

33:21.290 --> 33:22.291
Aren't you grateful?

33:26.170 --> 33:28.840
I'll keep your secret,
and we can be friends.

33:32.176 --> 33:33.094
Yeah.

33:33.928 --> 33:34.762
Thanks.

33:35.847 --> 33:36.973
If you're grateful,

33:38.224 --> 33:39.934
do me a small favor.

33:45.148 --> 33:46.065
What is it?

33:49.485 --> 33:50.319
Take it.

33:57.952 --> 34:00.121
You know that the Korean test
takes longer?

34:01.039 --> 34:02.331
Yes.

34:02.415 --> 34:03.666
So watch your time.

34:04.167 --> 34:05.501
- Yep!
- Yes.

34:06.169 --> 34:07.420
No cheating!

34:07.920 --> 34:09.172
Yes.

34:09.672 --> 34:10.757
Yes!

34:59.013 --> 35:01.641
There was a bug right here.

35:03.476 --> 35:04.602
Hey!

35:04.685 --> 35:05.812
What are you doing?

35:06.562 --> 35:07.730
Turn around.

35:23.538 --> 35:25.414
Well, it'd be weaker.

35:25.498 --> 35:27.625
But since it's a painkiller,

35:27.708 --> 35:29.669
you'd get dizzy and sleepy.

35:30.419 --> 35:31.921
Worst case, you'd vomit.

35:41.806 --> 35:47.186
In literature, an idea can be represented
by other related concepts or objects.

35:47.270 --> 35:49.856
The attributes can represent the object,

35:49.939 --> 35:52.984
or part of it can represent the whole.

35:53.067 --> 35:55.403
These methods can be mixed…

36:06.873 --> 36:08.624
Hey, where are you going?

37:32.250 --> 37:34.043
Hey, what are you doing?

37:48.224 --> 37:50.476
Hey, why are you doing that?

37:55.940 --> 37:56.857
It's nothing.

38:01.279 --> 38:03.030
- Two.
- Okay!

38:03.114 --> 38:03.948
Five.

38:04.740 --> 38:05.783
- I got three!
- Five.

38:06.450 --> 38:07.827
Next is social studies.

38:12.540 --> 38:13.457
One.

38:14.500 --> 38:15.626
One.

38:16.210 --> 38:18.254
Five. Four.

38:18.796 --> 38:19.714
Five.

38:20.423 --> 38:21.257
Five.

38:22.091 --> 38:22.967
Three.

38:24.135 --> 38:24.969
Two.

38:25.052 --> 38:27.513
- What? Two? Why?
- Five.

38:28.597 --> 38:29.598
Four.

38:30.599 --> 38:31.475
Three.

38:32.560 --> 38:33.519
One.

38:34.228 --> 38:35.146
Four.

39:02.089 --> 39:03.049
Yeon Si-eun.

39:04.425 --> 39:05.843
It's not what you think.

39:28.949 --> 39:30.326
Newton's second law.

39:30.409 --> 39:32.661
Force equals mass times acceleration.

39:35.498 --> 39:39.585
Using centrifugal force,
you get a much greater impact.

39:47.343 --> 39:48.886
You're fucking crazy!

39:56.602 --> 39:57.812
Hey, wait!

40:33.556 --> 40:34.890
I asked you.

40:36.892 --> 40:38.102
I told you to stop.

40:50.781 --> 40:52.783
Don't cross the line, all right?

40:52.867 --> 40:53.826
Know when to stop.

40:58.414 --> 40:59.248
What?

40:59.331 --> 41:03.335
Me? I'm like your guardian angel
who just woke up from a nap.

41:08.090 --> 41:09.049
Is this funny?

41:11.635 --> 41:12.595
A little bit.

43:55.299 --> 43:57.217
ALL NAMES, PLACES, AND EVENTS SHOWN
ARE FICTIONAL

43:57.301 --> 43:59.011
ANY SIMILARITY TO REALITY IS COINCIDENTAL

43:59.094 --> 44:02.389
Subtitle translation by: James Webb
